<section id="ox-event" class="panel bosses-panel" aria-labelledby="ox-event-title">
  <div class="panel-heading">
    <div><span class="eyebrow">EVENTS</span><h2 id="ox-event-title">OX quiz arena</h2></div>
    <button id="ox-event-refresh" class="button subtle" type="button">Refresh arena</button>
  </div>
  <div class="event-body">
    <p class="muted">Turn quiz mode on so the Entrance Ticket takes players into the OX arena (1340, 1492); with quiz mode off the ticket opens the Big Cube. Lock the gates while a question is asked, then send the losing side (X or O) out to (1341, 1465). Dead players on the losing side are revived.</p>
    <div class="bosses-toolbar">
      <label for="ox-event-reason">Reason for operation</label>
      <input id="ox-event-reason" minlength="3" maxlength="200" required placeholder="E.g. Saturday OX event" />
    </div>
    <p><strong>Quiz mode:</strong> <span id="ox-event-mode">Not queried</span> · <strong>Gates:</strong> <span id="ox-event-doors">Not queried</span> · <strong>Players:</strong> <span id="ox-event-players">Not queried</span></p>
    <div class="bosses-toolbar">
      <button id="ox-event-mode-on" class="button subtle" type="button" disabled>Quiz mode on</button>
      <button id="ox-event-mode-off" class="button subtle" type="button" disabled>Quiz mode off</button>
      <button id="ox-event-doors-lock" class="button subtle" type="button" disabled>Lock gates</button>
      <button id="ox-event-doors-open" class="button subtle" type="button" disabled>Open gates</button>
      <button id="ox-event-result-x" class="button subtle" type="button" disabled>X side loses</button>
      <button id="ox-event-result-o" class="button subtle" type="button" disabled>O side loses</button>
    </div>
    <p id="ox-event-message" class="form-message" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
    <p id="ox-event-asof" class="muted">No automatic refresh.</p>
  </div>
</section>
